<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index fell 3.75 to 633.59.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.08.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 338 to 219.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,689,845 compared with 26,553,000 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
